  "Description": "Looks up the fields of AnnData Proteomics Bridge (APB)\nresults by meaning, such as a PEP or an unnormalized intensity,\nwithout naming vendor columns. Reimplements the apb-catalog API\non the bundle apb-catalog releases: reviewed sets, apb2's rule\nlevels and expected answers. Reads APB results, as h5ad,\nParquet or DuckDB, into anndataR objects.",
